#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "29 May 2026 {#29-may-2026}"
msgstr "29 Mei 2026 {#29-may-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qiskit Code Assistant service discontinued** - The preview service has been discontinued and the Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab extensions have been archived.\n"
msgstr "**Perkhidmatan Qiskit Code Assistant dihentikan** - Perkhidmatan pratonton telah dihentikan dan sambungan Visual Studio Code serta JupyterLab telah diarkibkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr "  Berdasarkan maklum balas dan corak penggunaan, lebih ramai pengguna menjalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant secara tempatan dan bekerja dalam integrasi editor yang sudah menjadi sebahagian daripada aliran kerja pembangunan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Qiskit Code Assistant models remain available for local use. See the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr "  Model Qiskit Code Assistant kekal tersedia untuk kegunaan tempatan. Lihat dokumentasi [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Kemas kini terdahulu {#previous-updates}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 October 2025 {#28-october-2025}"
msgstr "28 Oktober 2025 {#28-october-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have updated the model available in the service to the newer `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model\n"
msgstr "Kami telah mengemas kini model yang tersedia dalam perkhidmatan kepada model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` yang lebih baharu\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have open-sourced two new models for local inference in Hugging Face:\n"
msgstr "Kami telah menyediakan sumber terbuka bagi dua model baharu untuk inferens tempatan dalam Hugging Face:\n"

